    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 25,
      "text": "An after-class arrangement"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Stopped Mo Yan at the academy gate after class and explained what his continued comfort was worth. He paid. Not because he was frightened of me — because paying was cheaper than the conversation.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "narrator",
      "text": "Recurs over several in-game days. The player chooses the rate and how visible it is.",
      "kind": "narration",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "face",
      "actor": "mo-yan",
      "target": "fang-yuan"
    },
    {
      "op": "gesture",
      "actor": "mo-yan",
      "gesture": "talk-point"
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 26,
      "text": "Chapter 26"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Second collection. Same gate, same hour. Predictability is the whole product: he budgets for it, and a budgeted loss is one nobody complains about loudly.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 27,
      "text": "Chapter 27"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Third collection. Two of his friends stayed to watch and then left without him, which told him more about his position than I did.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 28,
      "text": "Chapter 28"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Raised the rate. Still inside what his allowance absorbs. The ceiling on extortion is not courage, it is household accounting.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "title",
      "chapter": 29,
      "text": "Chapter 29"
    },
    {
      "op": "line",
      "actor": "fang-yuan",
      "text": "Counted the week: enough for the worm's wine and a margin. Also counted witnesses. Four students can place me at that gate, and one of them takes notes for a living.",
      "kind": "thought",
      "sfx": null
    },
    {
      "op": "choice",
      "id": "act1.extortion.toll.method",
      "prompt": "How hard do you press at the gate?",
      "method": "extortion",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "intimidate",
          "label": "Make the threat explicit.",
          "method": "intimidate"
        },
        {
          "id": "budget",
          "label": "Keep it small enough to be budgeted for.",
          "method": "budget"
        },
        {
          "id": "irregular",
          "label": "Vary the hour so nobody can plan around it.",
          "method": "irregular"
        }
      ]
    },
